  "source": "ans_snr40-50",
  "speaker": "ONlNEzMVabk/SPEAKER_03",
  "text": "जस्तै यौन हिंसाको सन्दर्भमा मैले के भने, मन मिलेसम्म लभ आफ्नो स्वार्थ पुरा भएन भने के भन्छ?",
  "real_audio": "/workspace/proc_data_new/ans_snr40-50.part1of2/train/audio/automated_new_set/UCo_hCisNRWC3pmRuuEqfP9A/ONlNEzMVabk/chunk_089_9.92s.wav",
  "duration": 9.92,
  "prompt": "/workspace/proc_data_new/ans_snr40-50.part1of2/train/audio/automated_new_set/UCo_hCisNRWC3pmRuuEqfP9A/ONlNEzMVabk/chunk_801_4.54s.wav"
 },
 {
  "id": "027",
  "source": "ans_snr40-50",
  "speaker": "c4h_X2I213Y/SPEAKER_01",
  "text": "यसरी नै राम्रो काम गर्दै जानु, अथवा जारी राख्नु।",
  "real_audio": "/workspace/proc_data_new/ans_snr40-50.part2of2/train/audio/automated_new_set/UCCIg2o64yeZNvECqROUbeEA/c4h_X2I213Y/chunk_441_3.80s.wav",
  "duration": 3.8,
  "prompt": "/workspace/proc_data_new/ans_snr40-50.part2of2/train/audio/automated_new_set/UCCIg2o64yeZNvECqROUbeEA/c4h_X2I213Y/chunk_180_4.38s.wav"
 },
 {
